  <!-- right lower realsense: a second D405 on its own stock Trossen mount, the
       chain above rolled 180 degrees about link_6's x axis (owner, 2026-10-23):
       under the wrist, looking along link_6's x axis from below as the upper
       one does from above. Its mount joint is measured, not CAD: the pose to
       the upper camera from both cameras' reads of one print at 80 stops of
       two runs (internal/evidence/wrist_pair.py), which agreed to 0.2 deg and
       0.8 mm; 1.76 deg and 1.96 mm off the stock bracket rolled pi. The rest
       of the chain is the stock one. -->
